  <text xml:lang="grc"><body xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.aichmalotides.dindorf1893-grc1"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.aichmalotides.dindorf1893-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_aichmalotides"><head>ΑΙΧΜΑΛΩΤΙΔΕΣ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="32" xml:id="fragment-aichmalotides-dindorf1893_grc1-32" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_aichmalotides">
            <note type="source">Harpocratio in ἀπομάττων. Σοφοκλῆς ἐν Αἰχμαλωτίσι</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Στρατοῦ καθαρτὴς κἀπομαγμάτων ἴδρις.</l>
            </lg>
            <note>καὶ πάλιν</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">Δεινότατος ἀπομάκτης τε μεγάλων συμφορῶν.</l>
            </lg>
            <note>Hesychius, Ἀπομάκτης· παρακαθάρτης.</note>
            <note type="source">Argumentum e Trojana historia sumptum docet auctor hypotheseos Ajacis. Agebant in eo Trojanæ mulieres captivæ, ut in Troasin Euripidis: sed diversa fuit tractandi ratio quam iniit Sophocles. Quantum enim ex exiguis reliquiis conjicere licet, satyricum fuit hoc drama. BRUNCK.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="33" xml:id="fragment-aichmalotides-dindorf1893_grc1-33" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_aichmalotides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.aichmalotides.nauck1889grc1:32">
            <note type="source">Pollux X, 190.</note>
            <quote>Αὐτὸ δὲ τὸ πήλινον, ὁ περιείληφε τὰ πλασθέντα κήρινα, ἃ κατὰ τὴν τοῦ πυρὸς προσφορὰν τήκεται, καὶ πολλὰ ἐκείνῳ τρυπήματα ἐναπολείπεται, ἡμίλιγδος καλεῖται· ὅθεν καὶ Σοφοκλῆς ἔφη ἐν Αἰχμαλωτίσιν</quote>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἀσπὶς μὲν ἡμίλιγδος ὡς πυκνὸν πατεῖ.</l>
            </lg>
            <note>Ad hunc locum spectat Hesychius in γλίδου χοάναι.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="34" xml:id="fragment-aichmalotides-dindorf1893_grc1-34" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_aichmalotides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.aichmalotides.pearson1917-grc1:36">
            <note type="source">Schol. Aristoph. ad Ranas 233.</note>
            <quote>Ὅτι οἱ ἀρχαῖοι καλάμῳ ἀντὶ κερατίου ἐχρῶντο. Σοφοκλῆς Αἰχμαλωτίσιν</quote>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ὑφηρέθη σου κάλαμος ὡσπερεὶ λύρας.</l>
            </lg>
            <note>Nomen fabulæ om. Pollux IV, 62.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="35" xml:id="fragment-aichmalotides-dindorf1893_grc1-35" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_aichmalotides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.aichmalotides.nauck1889grc1:34">
            <note type="source">Suidas in Ὑπὸ παντὶ λίθῳ — Σοφοκλῆς Αἰχμαλωτίσι</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἐν παντὶ γάρ τοι σκορπίος φρουρεῖ λίθῳ.</l>
            </lg>
            <note>Laudat hunc versum scholiastes quoque Nicandri ad Theriac. 19. Notissimum proverbium ad quod alludit comicus Thesmoph. 528. BRUNCK.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="36" xml:id="fragment-aichmalotides-dindorf1893_grc1-36" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_aichmalotides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.aichmalotides.nauck1889grc1:35">
            <note type="source">Stephanus in Βωμοί· τὸ τοπικὸν βώμιος, καὶ κατὰ παραγωγὴν βωμιαῖος. Σοφοκλῆς Αἰχμαλωτίσι</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Καὶ βωμιαῖον ἐσχάρας λαβών</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="37" xml:id="fragment-aichmalotides-dindorf1893_grc1-37" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_aichmalotides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.aichmalotides.nauck1889grc1:36">
            <note type="source">Stephanus in Εὐρώπη· λέγεται καὶ Εὐρώπεια, καὶ διὰ τοῦ ι Εὐρωπία παρὰ Σοφοκλεῖ ἐν Αἰχμαλωτίσι</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Καὶ νησιώτας καὶ μακρὰς Εὐρωπίας.</l>
            </lg>
            <note>μακρὰν Brunckius.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="38" xml:id="fragment-aichmalotides-dindorf1893_grc1-38" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_aichmalotides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.aichmalotides.nauck1889grc1:37">
            <note type="source">Stephanus, Χρύση, ἡ πόλις τοῦ Ἀπόλλωνος ἐγγὺς Λήμνου. Σοφοκλῆς ἐν Αἰχμαλωτίσιν</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ταύτην ἐγὼ Κίλλαν τε καὶ Χρύσην</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="39" xml:id="fragment-aichmalotides-dindorf1893_grc1-39" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_aichmalotides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.aichmalotides.nauck1889grc1:38">
            <note type="source">Photius p. 643, 7. Etymolog. M. p. 789, Φαῦλον·</note>
            <quote>τεθείη δ' ἂν καὶ ἐπὶ τοῦ μεγάλου</quote>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Εἰ μικρὸς ὢν τὰ φαῦλα νικήσας ἔχω.</l>
            </lg>
            <note>Σ. Α.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="40" xml:id="fragment-aichmalotides-dindorf1893_grc1-40" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_aichmalotides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.aichmalotides.nauck1889grc1:43">
            <note type="source">Herodianus περὶ μονήρους λέξεως p. 9, 9.</note>
            <quote>Παῡ Σοφοκλεῖ ἐν Αἰχμαλωτίσιν εἴρηται Σαρπηδὼν ἀκτή.</quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="41" xml:id="fragment-aichmalotides-dindorf1893_grc1-41" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_aichmalotides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.aichmalotides.nauck1889grc1:44">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Αἰχμόδετος: αἰχμάλωτος. Σοφοκλῆς Αἰχμαλωτίσιν.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="42" xml:id="fragment-aichmalotides-dindorf1893_grc1-42" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_aichmalotides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.aichmalotides.nauck1889grc1:45">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἀλιτρία Σοφοκλῆς Αἰχμαλωτίσι λέγει.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="43" xml:id="fragment-aichmalotides-dindorf1893_grc1-43" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_aichmalotides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.aichmalotides.nauck1889grc1:41">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἀμφίλινα κρούπαλα: Σοφοκλῆς Αἰχμαλωτίσι</note>
            <quote>“Πατὴρ δὲ χρυσδὺς ἀμφίλινα κρούπαλα.”</quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="44" xml:id="fragment-aichmalotides-dindorf1893_grc1-44" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_aichmalotides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.aichmalotides.nauck1889grc1:46">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἀνηκές: ἀνῆκον. Σ. Α. Codex ἀηκές et ἀῆκον.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="45" xml:id="fragment-aichmalotides-dindorf1893_grc1-45" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_aichmalotides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.aichmalotides.nauck1889grc1:47">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἀπειθής: ἀνυπότακτος, ἄπιστος. Σ. Α.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="46" xml:id="fragment-aichmalotides-dindorf1893_grc1-46" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_aichmalotides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.aichmalotides.nauck1889grc1:48">
            <note type="source">Grammaticus Bekkeri I. p. 447, 7. Ἀρτάνη: Σ. δὲ ἐν Α. ἐπὶ τοῦ δεσμοῦ.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="47" xml:id="fragment-aichmalotides-dindorf1893_grc1-47" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_aichmalotides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.aichmalotides.nauck1889grc1:49">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἄσεπτον: ἀσεβές. Σ. Α.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="48" xml:id="fragment-aichmalotides-dindorf1893_grc1-48" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_aichmalotides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.aichmalotides.nauck1889grc1:42">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἄχνην Λυδῆς κερκίδος. Σ. Α.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="49" xml:id="fragment-aichmalotides-dindorf1893_grc1-49" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_aichmalotides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.aichmalotides.nauck1889grc1:39">
            <note type="source">Suidas, Βαιαί: μικραί. καὶ βαιὸς ἰδίως ἀντὶ τοῦ εἰς. Σοφοκλῆς ἐν Αἰχμαλωτίσι</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Εσπεισα βαιᾶς κύλικος ὥστε δεύτερα.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="50" xml:id="fragment-aichmalotides-dindorf1893_grc1-50" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_aichmalotides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.aichmalotides.nauck1889grc1:50">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἐμπλεύρου: ἐνάλλου εἰς τὰς πλευράς. Σ. Α.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="51" xml:id="fragment-aichmalotides-dindorf1893_grc1-51" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_aichmalotides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.aichmalotides.nauck1889grc1:51">
            <note type="source">Etymolog. M. p. 344, 47. Ἐνόπαις: τοῖς ἐνωτίοις. ἀπὸ τοῦ ταῖς τῶν ὤτων ὀπαῖς κεῖσθαι. Σοφοκλῆς. Vulgo Ἐνοπαῖς. Nomen fabulæ et prosodia vocabuli cognoscitur ex loco corrupto Hesychii in ἐνώταις.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="52" xml:id="fragment-aichmalotides-dindorf1893_grc1-52" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_aichmalotides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.aichmalotides.nauck1889grc1:56">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ενστερνομαντίαις: ἐγγαστριμύθοις. Σ. Α. Pollux II, 162. schol. Platonis p. 372. et Suidas in ἐγγαστρίμυθος στερνόμαντιν ex Sophocle memorant.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="53" xml:id="fragment-aichmalotides-dindorf1893_grc1-53" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_aichmalotides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.aichmalotides.nauck1889grc1:52">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἐπιμάσσεται: ἐπαύξεται ἐπὶ πλέον. Σ. Α.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="54" xml:id="fragment-aichmalotides-dindorf1893_grc1-54" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_aichmalotides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.aichmalotides.nauck1889grc1:53">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἴαννα: ἐν μὲν Αἰχμαλωτίσι Σοφοκλέους ἀπέδοσαν Ἑλληνική· ἐπεὶ Ἰαννας τοὺς Ἕλληνας λέγουσιν. ἐν δὲ Τριπτολέμῳ ἐπὶ γυναικὸς, ὡς καὶ ἐν Ποιμέσι. τινὲς δὲ τὴν Ἑλένην. ἐπιεικῶς δὲ οἱ βάρβαροι τοὺς Ἕλληνας Ἴωνας λέγουσιν. ἐν δὲ Τρωίλῳ βάρβαρον θρήνημα τὸ ἰαί. ἢ ὄνομα γυναικός.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="55" xml:id="fragment-aichmalotides-dindorf1893_grc1-55" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_aichmalotides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.aichmalotides.nauck1889grc1:54">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἱερόλας: ἴσισυς (ἱερεύς Heringa). Σ. Α. ὡς καὶ τὸν γέροντα γεροιδὰν ἢ γεροῦντος λέγει. Fortasse ὡς καὶ τὸν γέροντα γηρόλαν λέγει. Ἱερόλας si ex trimetro est, ἱρόλας potius scribendum.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="56" xml:id="fragment-aichmalotides-dindorf1893_grc1-56" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_aichmalotides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.aichmalotides.nauck1889grc1:55">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ικτορεύσομεν: ἱκετεύσομεν. Σ. Α.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="57" xml:id="fragment-aichmalotides-dindorf1893_grc1-57" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_aichmalotides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.aichmalotides.nauck1889grc1:40">
            <note type="source">Chœroboscus, p. 140, 3. ed. Gaisf. Μύνης: Σ. Μύνου ἔκλινεν Αἰχμαλωτίσιν εἰπὼν</note>
            <quote>“Μύνου τ᾿ Ἐπιστρόφου τε.”</quote>
            <note type="commentary">Huc spectant schol. Hom. Il. O, 302. et Eustathius p. 1017, 10.</note>
          </div>
        </div></body></text></TEI>
